WEBVTT

NOTE
The D-District Prison rises — its corkscrew legs in the desert.
Duration: approximately 19 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
A gantry leads out from the prison structure.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.090
The view pulls back: the prison's three colossal corkscrew legs driven into the desert.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.600
The red prison perches atop them.
